Bind Npc 29056 Zone 21

On greeting
    Say "May the gods bless you..."
    Topic "[Premium Item Use]" goto event_400
    Goto close

On event_400
    Say "Which [Premium] item did you bring?"
    Topic "[DC Premium]" goto event_401
    Topic "[EXP Premium]" goto event_402
    Topic "[WAR Premium]" goto event_403
    Topic "[Switching Premium]" goto event_404
    Topic "[Platinum Premium]" goto event_405
    Topic "[Gold Premium]" goto event_406
    Topic "[Bronze Premium]" goto event_407
    Topic "Cancel" goto close

On event_401
    Say "Would you like to use the [DC Premium] benefit for 30 days?"
    Topic "Yes" goto event_411
    Topic "No" goto close

On event_411
    If player has 399281000
        Take 1 of 399281000
        Give dc premium for 30 days
    Else if player has 399281685
        Take 1 of 399281685
        Give dc premium for 30 days
    Else
        Say "You do not have a [DC Premium]. You can buy one in the Power-Up Store."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    Goto close

